Ontology(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mop/imports/iao_import.owl>
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mop/releases/2026-09-29/imports/iao_import.owl>
Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/source> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/iao/2026-03-30/iao.owl>)
